silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_concrete_anchor_1#vetrecord77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord77 is The veterinary record object in O_01 with the \"about\" arrow to Mittens. Sous reads Hom(VetRecord77, Mittens) = {about}. This is the positive case: the arrow exists and sous reports it. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetRecord77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
